{
  "bodyHash": "7564472be9fa55e8",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>Create：存储</h1>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>一款专为<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create（机械动力）模组</a>打造的全面存储扩展——包含分层级储物箱、可升级背包、互联存储网络以及智能物品传输方块。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/create_storage_2.png\" alt=\"create_storage_2.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-storage-neo-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/create-storage-neo-forge?logo=modrinth&label=Modrinth&color=00af5c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-storage-neo-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1281770?logo=curseforge&label=CurseForge&color=f16436\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Creators-of-Create/Create\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Create-6.0.7 -4b8bc2\" alt=\"Create\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/NeoForge-21.1.181 -d88231\" alt=\"NeoForged\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-47.3.30 -26303d\" alt=\"Forge\"></a>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Create：存储是什么？</h2>\n<p><strong>Create：存储</strong>为Create的自动化生态系统增添了专为该模组原生风格设计的存储解决方案。无论您是在装配线上需要紧凑的过滤容器、大容量散装存储、集中式的物品网络，还是希望拥有一个全能型探险背包——本模组都能满足您的需求。</p>\n<p>本模组最初由<strong>FoxyNoTail</strong>为Fabric平台开发，现为由社区积极维护的<strong>NeoForge/Forge</strong>移植版，并拥有比原版更丰富的功能。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1>存储箱</h1>\n<h3>描述</h3>\n<p><strong>存储箱</strong>与<strong>简易存储箱</strong>是专为紧凑且支持过滤的物品存储而设计的容器。每种<strong>存储箱</strong>变体提供不同的存储容量和视觉风格，而<strong>简易存储箱</strong>则专注于大容量的单一物品存储，并支持容量升级。它们旨在与Create模组内的机械与物流系统无缝集成，为您提供一种简洁高效的方式来管理海量物品。</p>\n<h2>存储箱</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>提供纸板、工业铁/风化铁、安山岩、铜、黄铜及硬化等多种材质变体</li>\n<li>内置Create过滤槽，可筛选允许存入或取出的物品</li>\n<li>箱体正面配备显示屏，显示物品数量及存储填充程度</li>\n<li>设有指示灯，用于提示箱子已满、已空或已启用销毁模式</li>\n<li><strong>存储箱</strong>支持玩家直接交互添加物品，无需打开GUI界面</li>\n<li>潜行时手持空手交互即可打开GUI界面</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/storage_box_cardboard.png\" alt=\"storage_box_cardboard.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/storage_box_industrial_iron.png\" alt=\"storage_box_industrial_iron.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/storage_box_weathered_iron.png\" alt=\"storage_box_weathered_iron.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/storage_box_andesite.png\" alt=\"storage_box_andesite.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/storage_box_copper.png\" alt=\"storage_box_copper.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/storage_box_brass.png\" alt=\"storage_box_brass.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/storage_box_hardened.png\" alt=\"storage_box_hardened.png\"></p>\n<h2>简易存储箱</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>常见木材材质变体（所有材质属性相同）</li>\n<li>默认最多存储2048个物品（仅限单一物品类型）</li>\n<li>潜行时手持空手交互即可打开GUI界面</li>\n<li><strong>物品过滤器</strong>：<ul>\n<li>存入物品时自动设置</li>\n<li>使用<strong>扳手</strong>交互可移除过滤器（仅在箱子为空时有效）</li></ul></li>\n<li><strong>升级模块</strong>：<ul>\n<li><em>销毁升级：</em>自动销毁（删除）溢出物品</li>\n<li>使用方法：手持升级模块交互正面显示屏，或通过GUI添加/移除</li>\n<li><em>容量升级：</em>使当前容量翻倍，最高可叠加9次</li>\n<li>使用方法：通过GUI添加/移除</li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_acacia.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_acacia.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_bamboo.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_bamboo.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_birch.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_birch.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_cherry.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_cherry.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_crimson.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_crimson.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_dark_oak.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_dark_oak.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_jungle.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_jungle.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_mangrove.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_mangrove.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_oak.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_oak.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_pale_oak.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_pale_oak.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_spruce.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_spruce.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/simple_storage_box_warped.png\" alt=\"simple_storage_box_warped.png\"></p>\n<p><em>注：基础最大容量为物品最大堆叠数量的32倍。</em><br>\n<em>示例：橡木原木 = 2048，末影珍珠 = 512，水桶 = 32</em></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>简易存储网络</h1>\n<h3>描述</h3>\n<p>将多个<strong>简易存储箱</strong>链接至单一网络，使玩家与自动化设备能够从一个或多个中心节点访问并管理所有存储物品。简易存储网络通过将<strong>简易存储箱</strong>连接到<strong>存储控制器</strong>来构建，中间使用<strong>存储饰条</strong>作为导流通道。连接完成后，<strong>存储控制器</strong>会汇总所有相连箱子的物品，并通过单一界面实现物品的存入与取出。</p>\n<p>此外，<strong>存储接口</strong>等附加组件可用于通过自动化设备（如漏斗、滑道、管道等）与网络进行交互。</p>\n<h2>存储饰条</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>用于连接简易存储箱与<strong>存储控制器</strong>和<strong>存储接口</strong>方块</li>\n<li>连接纹理与简易存储箱的材质变体相匹配</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_acacia.png\" alt=\"casing_acacia.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_bamboo.png\" alt=\"casing_bamboo.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_birch.png\" alt=\"casing_birch.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_cherry.png\" alt=\"casing_cherry.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_crimson.png\" alt=\"casing_crimson.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_dark_oak.png\" alt=\"casing_dark_oak.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_jungle.png\" alt=\"casing_jungle.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_mangrove.png\" alt=\"casing_mangrove.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_oak.png\" alt=\"casing_oak.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_pale_oak.png\" alt=\"casing_pale_oak.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_spruce.png\" alt=\"casing_spruce.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/casing_warped.png\" alt=\"casing_warped.png\"></p>\n<h2>存储控制器</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>作为存储网络的中央输入/输出枢纽</li>\n<li>使用<strong>存储饰条</strong>连接至<strong>简易存储箱</strong></li>\n<li>成功链接至少一个<strong>简易存储箱</strong>后，指示灯亮起</li>\n<li>支持手动交互与自动化设备接入（如漏斗、滑道、管道等）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/005c5f3d06b9b4b435d4e8591e0dbf4f04b2bac6/.github/images/storage_controller.png\" alt=\"storage_controller.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/005c5f3d06b9b4b435d4e8591e0dbf4f04b2bac6/.github/images/storage_controller_connected.png\" alt=\"storage_controller_connected.png\"></p>\n<h2>存储接口</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>功能类似<strong>存储控制器</strong>，但存在以下区别：<ul>\n<li>玩家无法直接通过它存入或取出物品</li>\n<li>无法独立发起或组建存储网络（必须依赖<strong>存储控制器</strong>）</li>\n<li>专为自动化输入/输出设计（如对接漏斗、滑道、管道等）</li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/005c5f3d06b9b4b435d4e8591e0dbf4f04b2bac6/.github/images/storage_interface.png\" alt=\"storage_interface.png\"></p>\n<h3>存储接口（过滤型）</h3>\n<p>与普通存储接口类似，但内置了Create过滤槽——非常适合在使用原版组件或混合自动化布局时精确控制流通物品。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/005c5f3d06b9b4b435d4e8591e0dbf4f04b2bac6/.github/images/storage_interface_filtered.png\" alt=\"storage_interface_filtered.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>背包</h1>\n<h3>描述</h3>\n<p>背包是一种可穿戴的存储道具，提供多种材质变体，每种均具备不同的存储容量与升级槽位。为与自动化系统无缝集成而设计，背包包含多个隔间：用于存放大量物品的主储物区、用于保管贵重装备的工具栏，以及专用的升级槽。借助磁力、物品补充、喂食、工具切换乃至飞行等模块化升级，背包的功能远超基础物品存储，使其成为探险、建造或自动化玩法中不可或缺的得力伙伴。</p>\n<h2>背包</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>提供工业铁、安山岩、铜、黄铜及硬化材质背包</li>\n<li>每个背包最多可安装六个升级模块，佩戴后将改变背包的工作方式</li>\n<li>不同材质的背包每个槽位可容纳的物品数量不同</li>\n<li>存储空间分为三个隔间：<ul>\n<li><strong>主储物区：</strong>主要存储区域，物品可与漏斗、滑道、管道等自动化设备进行交互</li>\n<li><strong>工具储物区：</strong>安全隔间，用于存放工具或珍贵物品（自动化设备无法交互）</li>\n<li><strong>升级槽：</strong>用于存放背包升级模块；通过[Ctrl] + 右键启用或禁用</li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack.png\" alt=\"backpack.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_andesite.png\" alt=\"backpack_andesite.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_brass.png\" alt=\"backpack_brass.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_copper.png\" alt=\"backpack_copper.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_hardened.png\" alt=\"backpack_hardened.png\"></p>\n<h2>背包升级</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>物品</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_magnet.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_magnet.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>磁吸升级</strong></td>\n<td>可从最多5格外将物品吸入背包主储物格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_itempickup.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_itempickup.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>物品拾取升级</strong></td>\n<td>将拾取的物品直接存入背包主储物格，而非玩家背包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_pickblock.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_pickblock.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>快捷选取升级</strong></td>\n<td>可直接从背包中使用快捷选取功能获取物品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_refill.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_refill.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>自动补给升级</strong></td>\n<td>当背包中有对应物品时，自动为玩家的主手或副手物品进行补充</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_toolswap.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_toolswap.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>工具切换升级</strong></td>\n<td>在挖掘方块或攻击实体时，自动将玩家主手持有的工具替换为当前可用的最佳工具或武器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_feeder.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_feeder.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>自动喂食升级</strong></td>\n<td>当玩家饥饿度较低时，自动从背包中喂食食物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_flight.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_flight.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>飞行升级</strong></td>\n<td>将任意背包变为具有悬停功能的喷气背包（使用Create模组的后箱作为燃料）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_falling.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_falling.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>防摔升级</strong></td>\n<td>穿戴该背包时可防止玩家受到坠落伤害</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/005c5f3d06b9b4b435d4e8591e0dbf4f04b2bac6/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_oremining.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_oremining.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>自动采矿升级</strong></td>\n<td>自动开采整簇匹配的矿石方块，并将掉落物生成在玩家附近</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/005c5f3d06b9b4b435d4e8591e0dbf4f04b2bac6/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_torchdeployer.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_torchdeployer.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>火把放置升级</strong></td>\n<td>当周围光照等级过低时，自动从背包中放置火把</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/005c5f3d06b9b4b435d4e8591e0dbf4f04b2bac6/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_jukebox.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_jukebox.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>唱片机升级</strong></td>\n<td>播放背包音乐唱片槽中的唱片，提供增益效果与氛围音效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/005c5f3d06b9b4b435d4e8591e0dbf4f04b2bac6/.github/images/backpack_upgrade_health.png\" alt=\"backpack_upgrade_health.png\"></td>\n<td><strong>机械之心升级</strong></td>\n<td>为穿戴者提供额外的生命值（可配置）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h1>传输方块</h1>\n<h3>描述</h3>\n<p>传输方块是一种用于在相邻容器之间传输物品的实用方块。它们的工作方式类似于漏斗，每次只移动一个物品，但自身不携带任何内部存储空间。智能传输方块在此基础上进行了扩展，支持物品过滤，并允许单次最多传输64个物品。</p>\n<h2>基础传输方块</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>直接在容器之间（包括原版存储方块）传输物品</li>\n<li>按照朝向方向传输物品（可使用Create模组的扳手进行旋转）</li>\n<li>每次仅移动一个物品，类似于漏斗</li>\n<li>无内部存储空间——物品会瞬间直接通过</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/passer_block.png\" alt=\"passer_block.png\"></p>\n<h2>智能传输方块</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>继承基础传输方块的所有功能</li>\n<li>支持使用过滤器进行物品筛选</li>\n<li>可通过数值面板调整传输数量（点击并保持按住过滤器槽位即可调节）</li>\n<li>接收到红石信号时会停止传输物品</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/smart_passer_block.png\" alt=\"smart_passer_block.png\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ausmez/create-storage-neo-forge/759f20af15da4531ad91f1d817fb35a3a8698259/.github/images/smart_passer_block_powered.png\" alt=\"smart_passer_block_powered.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>兼容性</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模组</th>\n<th>支持情况</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Create</strong></td>\n<td>必需 —— 深度整合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Packager / Stock Keeper</strong></td>\n<td>完整集成物流网络支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>JEI / EMI / REI</strong></td>\n<td>支持从背包库存中转配方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Curios</strong></td>\n<td>支持背包背饰槽位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Every Compat (Wood Good)</strong></td>\n<td>为简易存储箱和装饰条提供模组木材类型支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Construction Wand/Sticks</strong></td>\n<td>支持放置背包和存储箱方块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Create Aeronautics</strong></td>\n<td>对已组装的装置中的所有组件提供完整支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2>前置要求</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Minecraft：</strong>1.21.1 / 1.20.1</li>\n<li><strong>模组加载器：</strong>NeoForge 21.1.181+ / Forge 47.3.30+</li>\n<li><strong>Create：</strong>6.0.7+</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>致谢</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>FoxyNoTail</strong> —— 原始模组概念与Fabric版本实现</li>\n<li><strong>ausmez</strong> —— NeoForge/Forge端口移植及持续开发</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><em>本模组遵循 GNU GPL 3.0 许可证开源</em></p>",
